    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n89087" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προσεννέπω</span></b> , impf.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προσήνεπον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pi.
					<u>P.</u>
					4.97
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				9.29
			</span></i>:—<i>address, accost</i>, ll.cc., <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Aj.</u>
				857
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Or.</u>
				428
			</span></i>, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> c. acc.
			et inf., <i>entreat</i> or <i>command</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινὰ σπέσθαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pi.
					<u>I.</u>
					6(5).17
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. τινά τι</span>
			<i>call</i> by a name, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῦτό νιν π.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Ag.</u>
					162
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.), cf. <i><span class="en">
				1291
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
